# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Vite copies `public/` to the output root, which
# is where Pages expects this file.

# `/docs` has no page of its own — the Guide group starts at the introduction —
# but it is the URL a reader gets by trimming any docs URL, and it would
# otherwise answer 404. Both spellings are listed so that neither depends on how
# Pages matches a trailing slash.
/docs /docs/introduction 301
/docs/ /docs/introduction 301
